{
 "_comment": [
  "LONG-FLOW pack: 3 real production sites, 34 subgoals, no credentials, no payments.",
  "Deliberately NOT part of bench/smoke.sh (these platforms are external and slow/flaky).",
  "Run with",
  "  node --experimental-strip-types src/bench.ts --cases bench/cases-live-long.json --mode-tag live-long",
  "Each case is ONE long journey rather than the single-click shapes of",
  "bench/cases-live.json, so it exercises what a short case cannot: state that must",
  "survive a re-goto (a server-side cart), a subgoal that needs SEVERAL actions",
  "(target_hints + its own slots), a sort whose order lives only in JS, a form whose fill",
  "is judged by its EFFECT, composed signals (all_of / not), a `when` guard, a login/logout",
  "cycle and a JS-rendered page. Every signal was verified by hand against the live DOM",
  "(false before the action, true after) before being frozen here; the evidence and the",
  "three real defects this pack exposed are in bench/LONG_FLOW_REPORT.md.",
  "Values live in `slots` (plan data), never in prose: the executor may not invent a",
  "username, a sort key or a postcode.",
  "  live-long-saucedemo-checkout  15 subgoals  live:www.saucedemo.com    (stateful E2E)",
  "  live-long-books               10 subgoals  live:books.toscrape.com   (navigation)",
  "  live-long-quotes               9 subgoals  live:quotes.toscrape.com  (session + JS)"
 ],
